msgstr "Uw account is bijna klaar, even geduld..."

#: src/strings.ts:453
#: src/strings.ts:1595
msgid "Your account is now 100% secure against unauthorized logins."
msgstr "Je account is nu 100% beveiligd tegen ongeautoriseerde aanmeldingen."

#: src/strings.ts:1694
